/**
 * Tool-selection KNN training data — query → tools mappings.
 *
 * Hand-curated synthetic dataset built over the product's test rounds,
 * covering all 12 skill modules. Used by `embeddings.ts` for tool selection:
 * each tool is scored by its best cosine match across its description and
 * the examples labelled with it here.
 *
 * Imported directly so the data is bundled into the compiled JS — no
 * runtime filesystem lookup, no build-pipeline copy step. If you add a
 * new tool, also add at least one representative example here.
 */

